## 19.3 AWS 백업 활용하기

### 19.3.1 AWS 백업을 활용해 EC2 인스턴스 백업 및 복원해보기

```bash
**클라우드포메이션 스택 생성 순서** : VPC.yml -> Security_Group.yml -> EC2.yml -> Backup.yml
```

- Backup.yml

```bash
AWSTemplateFormatVersion: "2010-09-09"
Description: Create AWS Backup

# ------------------------------------------------------------#
# Input Parameters
# ------------------------------------------------------------#

Parameters:
  SystemName:
    Description: "System name of each resource names."
    Type: String
    Default: "gr"
  EnvName:
    Description: "Environment name of each resource names."
    Type: String
    Default: "product"

# ------------------------------------------------------------#
# Create Backup Vault
# ------------------------------------------------------------# 
Resources:
  EC2BackupVault:
    Type: "AWS::Backup::BackupVault" # 백업볼트 이름과 속성 지정
    Properties:
      BackupVaultName: !Sub ${SystemName}-${EnvName}-bv-ec2
      BackupVaultTags:
        Name: !Sub ${SystemName}-${EnvName}-bv-ec2
        Env: !Sub ${EnvName}

# ------------------------------------------------------------#
# Create Backup Plan
# ------------------------------------------------------------# 
  EC2BackupPlan:
    Type: AWS::Backup::BackupPlan # 백업 계획 설정
    Properties:
      BackupPlan:
        BackupPlanName: !Sub ${SystemName}-${EnvName}-bp-ec2
        BackupPlanRule: # 백업 규칙 설정
          - RuleName: !Sub ${SystemName}-${EnvName}-bprule-ec2
            TargetBackupVault: !Ref EC2BackupVault # 백업 볼트 지정
            ScheduleExpression: cron(0 * * * ? *) # 백업 시간대 지정 : 매 시간마다
            ScheduleExpressionTimezone: Asia/Seoul # 기준 시간대 : 서울
            StartWindowMinutes: 60 # 한 시간 이내에 백업 시작
            CompletionWindowMinutes: 120 # 두 시간 이내에 백업 종료
            Lifecycle:
              DeleteAfterDays: 7 # 백업물 7일동안 보관, 7일 이상된 백업 삭제
      BackupPlanTags:
        Name: !Sub ${SystemName}-${EnvName}-bp-ec2
        Env: !Sub ${EnvName}

# ------------------------------------------------------------#
# Create Backup Selection
# ------------------------------------------------------------# 
  EC2BackupSelection: # 백업할 리소스 지정
    Type: AWS::Backup::BackupSelection
    Properties:
      BackupPlanId: !Ref EC2BackupPlan
      BackupSelection: # 백업 수행할 리소스 지정
        SelectionName: !Sub ${SystemName}-${EnvName}-selection-ec2
        IamRoleArn: !GetAtt EC2BackupRole.Arn # IAM 역할 할당
        ListOfTags: 
          - ConditionType: "STRINGEQUALS"
            ConditionKey: Name
            ConditionValue: gr-product-ec2

# ------------------------------------------------------------#
# Create Backup Role
# ------------------------------------------------------------# 
  EC2BackupRole:
    Type: "AWS::IAM::Role"
    Properties:
      RoleName: !Sub ${SystemName}-p-role-backup-ec2
      AssumeRolePolicyDocument:
        Version: "2012-10-17"
        Statement:
        - Effect: "Allow"
          Action: "sts:AssumeRole"
          Principal:
            Service: "backup.amazonaws.com"
      ManagedPolicyArns:
        - "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSBackupServiceRolePolicyForBackup" # 백업 수행 권한
        - "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSBackupServiceRolePolicyForRestores" # 복원 수행 권한
      Path: "/service-role/"
```

